"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment9:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment9","raw_text":"红方未进车先跳八路马也是当头炮常用的布局。","text":"红方未进车先跳八路马也是当头炮常用的布局。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":9,"anchor_node_id":"0:9","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment10:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment10","raw_text":"针对红方的马八进七，黑方飞象是最常用的应手。","text":"针对红方的马八进七，黑方飞象是最常用的应手。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":10,"anchor_node_id":"0:10","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment11:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment11","raw_text":"我们这一盘棋就详细解说红方跳八路马与黑方飞三路象之後的进车过河的各种攻势。","text":"我们这一盘棋就详细解说红方跳八路马与黑方飞三路象之後的进车过河的各种攻势。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":11,"anchor_node_id":"0:11","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment12:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment12","raw_text":"黑方平包兑车是应法的一种。","text":"黑方平包兑车是应法的一种。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":12,"anchor_node_id":"0:12","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment13:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment13","raw_text":"站在红方的立场不鼓励进车兑车，平车压马才是一种气魄。","text":"站在红方的立场不鼓励进车兑车，平车压马才是一种气魄。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":13,"anchor_node_id":"0:13","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment14:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment14","raw_text":"黑方进车保马是当然的一步棋，次一著包九退一再平包打车，这是黑方的订单。","text":"黑方进车保马是当然的一步棋，次一著包九退一再平包打车，这是黑方的订单。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":14,"anchor_node_id":"0:14","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment15:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment15","raw_text":"红方跃马盘河乃当然之著，这一步棋牵制黑方的包九退一。","text":"红方跃马盘河乃当然之著，这一步棋牵制黑方的包九退一。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":15,"anchor_node_id":"0:15","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment16:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment16","raw_text":"如果黑方包九退一想要平包打车。","text":"如果黑方包九退一想要平包打车。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":16,"anchor_node_id":"0:16","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment17:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment17","raw_text":"红方进马踩马，黑方来不及平包打车。","text":"红方进马踩马，黑方来不及平包打车。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":17,"anchor_node_id":"0:17","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_16:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_16","raw_text":"所以这一步棋黑方不能退包。黑方如果进二路包过河，次一著要平包去红方的三路兵，驱赶红方的三路车。","text":"所以这一步棋黑方不能退包。黑方如果进二路包过河，次一著要平包去红方的三路兵，驱赶红方的三路车。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":16,"anchor_node_id":"1:16","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_17:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_17","raw_text":"红方马六进四就可以防止黑方的平炮射兵了。","text":"红方马六进四就可以防止黑方的平炮射兵了。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":17,"anchor_node_id":"1:17","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_18:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_18","raw_text":"黑方只好支士。","text":"黑方只好支士。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":18,"anchor_node_id":"1:18","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_19:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_19","raw_text":"红方进九路兵，次一著可以进车抓黑方的二路包。","text":"红方进九路兵，次一著可以进车抓黑方的二路包。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":19,"anchor_node_id":"1:19","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_20:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_20","raw_text":"黑方平车贴身。","text":"黑方平车贴身。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":20,"anchor_node_id":"1:20","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_21:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_21","raw_text":"红方进车抓包。","text":"红方进车抓包。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":21,"anchor_node_id":"1:21","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_22:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_22","raw_text":"如果黑方进车守包。","text":"如果黑方进车守包。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":22,"anchor_node_id":"1:22","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_23:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_23","raw_text":"红方只要支士预防黑方平包去兵叫将就可以了。","text":"红方只要支士预防黑方平包去兵叫将就可以了。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":23,"anchor_node_id":"1:23","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_22:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_22","raw_text":"所以黑方要进车抓马逼兑。","text":"所以黑方要进车抓马逼兑。","source_line_id":"2","source_after_ply":22,"anchor_node_id":"2:22","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_25:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_25","raw_text":"兑子之後该红方下，由这个局势可以很明显看出黑方右侧防守非常薄弱。","text":"兑子之後该红方下，由这个局势可以很明显看出黑方右侧防守非常薄弱。","source_line_id":"2","source_after_ply":25,"anchor_node_id":"2:25","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_26:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_26","raw_text":"红方进车抓马，这一苹马无路可逃只好退到四路来。","text":"红方进车抓马，这一苹马无路可逃只好退到四路来。","source_line_id":"2","source_after_ply":26,"anchor_node_id":"2:26","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_27:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_27","raw_text":"红方平炮射兵，黑方右方空虚异常，局面到此红方大占优势。","text":"红方平炮射兵，黑方右方空虚异常，局面到此红方大占优势。","source_line_id":"2","source_after_ply":27,"anchor_node_id":"2:27","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_16:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_16","raw_text":"我们回头过来看，当这个局面，黑方刚刚进二路包，变化的结果黑方不利。黑方支士比较实惠。","text":"我们回头过来看，当这个局面，黑方刚刚进二路包，变化的结果黑方不利。黑方支士比较实惠。","source_line_id":"3","source_after_ply":16,"anchor_node_id":"3:16","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_17:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_17","raw_text":"红方马六进四避开黑方贴身车抓马。","text":"红方马六进四避开黑方贴身车抓马。","source_line_id":"3","source_after_ply":17,"anchor_node_id":"3:17","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_18:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_18","raw_text":"黑方进二路包牵制红方四路马的要津。","text":"黑方进二路包牵制红方四路马的要津。","source_line_id":"3","source_after_ply":18,"anchor_node_id":"3:18","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_19:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_19","raw_text":"平炮明车。||||红方要平这一苹八路炮一定要平到九路，不要平到七路。因为如果平炮七路，黑方也包二平三，这样黑方可以牵制红方九路车的走动，因为黑方随时会打红方的七路相。所以红方要平到九路，这个观念玩家要体会的出来。","text":"平炮明车。\n\n红方要平这一苹八路炮一定要平到九路，不要平到七路。因为如果平炮七路，黑方也包二平三，这样黑方可以牵制红方九路车的走动，因为黑方随时会打红方的七路相。所以红方要平到九路，这个观念玩家要体会的出来。","source_line_id":"3","source_after_ply":19,"anchor_node_id":"3:19","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_20:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_20","raw_text":"黑方车一平二。","text":"黑方车一平二。","source_line_id":"3","source_after_ply":20,"anchor_node_id":"3:20","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_21:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_21","raw_text":"红方也车九平八牵制住。","text":"红方也车九平八牵制住。","source_line_id":"3","source_after_ply":21,"anchor_node_id":"3:21","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_22:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_22","raw_text":"黑方进车抓马。","text":"黑方进车抓马。","source_line_id":"3","source_after_ply":22,"anchor_node_id":"3:22","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_23:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_23","raw_text":"红方顺势跳马，次一著准备卧槽。","text":"红方顺势跳马，次一著准备卧槽。","source_line_id":"3","source_after_ply":23,"anchor_node_id":"3:23","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_24:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_24","raw_text":"黑方平车抓马。","text":"黑方平车抓马。","source_line_id":"3","source_after_ply":24,"anchor_node_id":"3:24","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_26:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_26","raw_text":"红方跳马卧槽，引诱黑方退车挡马腿。","text":"红方跳马卧槽，引诱黑方退车挡马腿。","source_line_id":"3","source_after_ply":26,"anchor_node_id":"3:26","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_27:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_27","raw_text":"再进车去包要求兑子。","text":"再进车去包要求兑子。","source_line_id":"3","source_after_ply":27,"anchor_node_id":"3:27","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_28:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_28","raw_text":"很明显可以看出兑子之後，黑方变成黑暗的三路车。","text":"很明显可以看出兑子之後，黑方变成黑暗的三路车。","source_line_id":"3","source_after_ply":28,"anchor_node_id":"3:28","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_29:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_29","raw_text":"红方再进车表面上是抓马，事实上是隐藏著炮九进四去卒的攻势。","text":"红方再进车表面上是抓马，事实上是隐藏著炮九进四去卒的攻势。","source_line_id":"3","source_after_ply":29,"anchor_node_id":"3:29","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_30:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_30","raw_text":"黑方退九路包随时可以平包打车。","text":"黑方退九路包随时可以平包打车。","source_line_id":"3","source_after_ply":30,"anchor_node_id":"3:30","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_31:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_31","raw_text":"红方也进炮取边卒。","text":"红方也进炮取边卒。","source_line_id":"3","source_after_ply":31,"anchor_node_id":"3:31","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_32:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_32","raw_text":"黑方平包打车。","text":"黑方平包打车。","source_line_id":"3","source_after_ply":32,"anchor_node_id":"3:32","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_34:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_34","raw_text":"打车之後，黑方车三退一防守红方的沉底炮。","text":"打车之後，黑方车三退一防守红方的沉底炮。","source_line_id":"3","source_after_ply":34,"anchor_node_id":"3:34","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_35:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_35","raw_text":"红方得以进二抓包。","text":"红方得以进二抓包。","source_line_id":"3","source_after_ply":35,"anchor_node_id":"3:35","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_36:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_36","raw_text":"黑方很无奈的包七平八。","text":"黑方很无奈的包七平八。","source_line_id":"3","source_after_ply":36,"anchor_node_id":"3:36","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_37:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_37","raw_text":"红方炮五平九，黑方很难应付红方这一苹沉底炮的攻势，局面到此红方占绝对的优势。||||这盘棋黑方第6手平包邀兑之後，虽然有进车保马的棋，但红方跃马盘河，这一苹盘河马非常的厉害，牵制黑方所有子力的行动，这也是红方致胜的原因。本布局就介绍到这边，谢谢！","text":"红方炮五平九，黑方很难应付红方这一苹沉底炮的攻势，局面到此红方占绝对的优势。\n\n这盘棋黑方第6手平包邀兑之後，虽然有进车保